<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="task" id="send-prompt">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Enter a request and send it to the active model.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Send a Prompt</title>
  <p>Enter a coding request in the prompt area and submit it to the active model. The response appears in the conversation area as it streams.</p>
  <steps>
    <item><p>Click in the prompt area and enter your request.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose <gui style="button">Send</gui>, or press <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Return</key>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Read the response and any tool activity in the conversation area.</p></item>
  </steps>
  <note><p>Press <key>Shift</key>+<key>Return</key> to insert a new line instead of sending.</p></note>
</page>
